{"Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nHnut\u00ed za ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va vydalo cestovn\u00ed v\u00fdstrahu pro Missouri": "Travel warning issued by the rights movement for Missouri", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nN\u00e1rodn\u00ed asociace pro zv\u00fdhod\u0148ov\u00e1n\u00ed barevn\u00fdch lid\u00ed (NAACP) zve\u0159ejnila varov\u00e1n\u00ed pro barevn\u00e9 lidi cestuj\u00edc\u00ed do Missouri na z\u00e1klad\u011b diskrimina\u010dn\u00edch z\u00e1sad st\u00e1tu a rasistick\u00fdch \u00fatok\u016f.": "National Association for the Advancement of Colored People (NAACP) issued a warning to people traveling to Missouri based on discriminatory state laws and racist attacks.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\n\u201eCestovn\u00ed doporu\u010den\u00ed NAACP pro st\u00e1t Missouri, s \u00fa\u010dinnost\u00ed od 28. srpna 2017, vyz\u00fdv\u00e1 afroamerick\u00e9 cestuj\u00edc\u00ed, n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edky a obyvatele Missouri, aby p\u0159i cestov\u00e1n\u00ed nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d st\u00e1tem dbali zv\u00fd\u0161en\u00e9 pozornosti v d\u016fsledku s\u00e9rie sporn\u00fdch rasov\u011b motivovan\u00fdch incident\u016f, ke kter\u00fdm v sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b doch\u00e1z\u00ed v cel\u00e9m st\u00e1tu,\u201c stoj\u00ed v prohl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed asociace.": "Travel advisories of the NAACP for Missouri, effective August 28, 2017, urge African American travelers and residents to exercise increased caution while traveling throughout the state due to a series of racially motivated incidents currently occurring in the state.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nNAACP uvedlo, \u017ee k tomuto kroku p\u0159istoupilo na z\u00e1klad\u011b sou\u010dasn\u00fdch z\u00e1kon\u016f st\u00e1tu Missouri, kter\u00e9 znesnad\u0148uj\u00ed obhajobu rasisticky motivovan\u00fdch \u010din\u016f p\u0159ed soudem, stejn\u011b jako v d\u016fsledku jedn\u00e1n\u00ed org\u00e1n\u016f \u010dinn\u00fdch v trestn\u00edm \u0159\u00edzen\u00ed, kter\u00e9 nep\u0159im\u011b\u0159en\u011b c\u00edl\u00ed na men\u0161iny.": "They have taken this step based on the current Missouri state laws that enable the defense of racist acts before court, as well as due to the actions of agencies involved in criminal proceedings which disproportionately target minorities.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\n\u201eDoch\u00e1z\u00ed k poru\u0161ov\u00e1n\u00ed ob\u010dansk\u00fdch pr\u00e1v.": "\"Something is being destroyed.\"", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nLid\u00e9 jsou zastavov\u00e1ni policisty jen kv\u016fli barv\u011b sv\u00e9 pleti, jsou napad\u00e1n nebo zab\u00edjeni,\u201c uvedl pro Kansas City Star prezident NAACP pro Missouri Rod Chapel.": "They are stopped by police just because of the color of their skin, they're attacked or killed,\" said President NAACP for Missouri Rod Chapel in response to the situation.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\n\u201eHromad\u00ed se n\u00e1m dosud nejv\u011bt\u0161\u00ed mno\u017estv\u00ed st\u00ed\u017enost\u00ed.\u201c": "\"Despite our complaints, we still have the most problems.\"", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nJedn\u00e1 se o prvn\u00ed varov\u00e1n\u00ed sv\u00e9ho druhu, kter\u00e9 organizace vydala pro st\u00e1t USA.": "It is the first warning of its species that an organization issued for the United States state.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nMezi incidenty, kter\u00e9 organizace citovala, byly rasov\u011b motivovan\u00e9 nad\u00e1vky sm\u011b\u0159ovan\u00e9 v\u016f\u010di student\u016fm \u010dern\u00e9 pleti na University of Missouri a smrt Toryho Sanderse, mu\u017ee \u010dern\u00e9 pleti z Tennessee.": "racially motivated hate speech incidents cited by the organization were directed against African American students at the University of Missouri and the death of Tennessee politician Tory Sanderse.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nSanders zem\u0159el za sporn\u00fdch okolnost\u00ed na za\u010d\u00e1tku leto\u0161n\u00edho roku pot\u00e9,co mu p\u0159i cestov\u00e1n\u00ed nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d st\u00e1tem do\u0161el benz\u00edn a policie jej uvrhla do vazby bez obvin\u011bn\u00ed ze sp\u00e1ch\u00e1n\u00ed zlo\u010dinu.": "He died under suspicious circumstances at the beginning of this year after his car ran out of fuel and police took him into custody without charges.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nCestovn\u00ed doporu\u010den\u00ed rovn\u011b\u017e upozor\u0148uje na ned\u00e1vn\u00e9 prohl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00edho st\u00e1tn\u00edho zastupitelstv\u00ed st\u00e1tu Missouri, kter\u00e9 uv\u00e1d\u00ed, \u017ee \u0159idi\u010di \u010dern\u00e9 pleti maj\u00ed o 75 % vy\u0161\u0161\u00ed \u0161anci, \u017ee je zastav\u00ed policie.": "Travel advice also warns about the latest statement from the state's highest official, which states that drivers of black hair have a 75% higher chance of being stopped by police.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\n\u201e\u00da\u010delem cestovn\u00edho doporu\u010den\u00ed je upozor\u0148ovat lidi a varovat jejich rodiny, p\u0159\u00e1tele a spolupracovn\u00edky p\u0159ed t\u00edm, co by se mohlo p\u0159ihodit v Missouri,\u201c \u0159ekl Chapel.": "\"Tourist guide's purpose is to warn people and their families, friends and colleagues beforehand what might happen in Missouri.\"", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\n\u201eLid\u00e9 musej\u00ed b\u00fdt p\u0159ipraveni - m\u011bli by s sebou vozit pen\u00edze na p\u0159\u00edpadnou \u00fahradu kauce nebo upozornit sv\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edbuzn\u00e9, \u017ee se chystaj\u00ed cestovat st\u00e1tem.\u201c": "People must be prepared - they should bring money for the next tax or inform their relatives that they are going abroad.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nPodle aktu\u00e1ln\u00edch \u010d\u00edsel programu FBI k hl\u00e1\u0161en\u00ed nen\u00e1vistn\u00fdch \u010din\u016f do\u0161lo v roce 2015 v Missouri ke stovce p\u0159\u00edpad\u016f nen\u00e1vistn\u00e9ho chov\u00e1n\u00ed, co\u017e dosazuje st\u00e1t na \u0161estn\u00e1ct\u00e9 m\u00edsto mezi v\u0161emi st\u00e1ty.": "According to the latest numbers from the FBI for reporting hate crimes, there were over 500 reported incidents of hate behavior in Missouri in 2015, placing the state at the 16th place among all states.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nCestovn\u00ed v\u00fdstraha je z\u00e1rove\u0148 odpov\u011bd\u00ed na nov\u00fd z\u00e1kon Missouri, kter\u00fd znesnad\u0148uje za\u017ealov\u00e1n\u00ed spole\u010dnosti za diskriminaci p\u0159i poskytov\u00e1n\u00ed ubytov\u00e1n\u00ed nebo zam\u011bstn\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed.": "Travel warning is also a response to a new law in Missouri that allows companies to sue for discrimination when providing housing or employment.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nAmerick\u00fd svaz pro ob\u010dansk\u00e9 svobody (ACLU) vydal cestovn\u00ed doporu\u010den\u00ed pro Texas a Arizonu pot\u00e9, co st\u00e1ty schv\u00e1lily imigra\u010dn\u00ed z\u00e1kon, je\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje st\u00e1tn\u00edm \u010dinitel\u016fm zadr\u017eet lidi na z\u00e1klad\u011b poru\u0161en\u00ed tohoto z\u00e1kona, kter\u00fd m\u00e1 podle ACLU zlep\u0161it rasovou profilaci.": "Travel advisory for Texas and Arizona issued by the American Civil Liberties Union (ACLU) after states approved an immigration law that allows state officials to detain individuals based on violating this law, which ACLU claims will improve racial profiling.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nCestovn\u00ed doporu\u010den\u00ed obvykle vyd\u00e1v\u00e1 ministerstvo zahrani\u010d\u00ed pro zahrani\u010dn\u00ed zem\u011b, ale v posledn\u00ed dob\u011b se advoka\u010dn\u00ed skupiny uch\u00fdlily k t\u011bmto opat\u0159en\u00edm v odpov\u011bdi na konkr\u00e9tn\u00ed z\u00e1kony a trendy v r\u00e1mci USA.": "Travel advice usually issued by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs for foreign countries, but in recent times, advocacy groups have turned to these measures as a response to specific laws and trends within the United States.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nModelka byla zabita \u0161\u00e9fkucha\u0159em.": "She was killed by a chef.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nJej\u00ed rodina ani po 12 letech nem\u00e1 klid!": "Her family has been without peace for over a decade.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nZavra\u017ed\u011bnou je modelka Sally Anne Bowman.": "She was assassinated.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nD\u00edvka p\u016fvodem z Croydonu byla v roce 2005 zavra\u017ed\u011bna \u0161\u00e9fkucha\u0159em Markem Dixiem p\u0159\u00edmo v restauraci, ve kter\u00e9 pracovala, ten j\u00ed zasadil bodn\u00e9 r\u00e1ny.": "Girl originally from Croydon was murdered by chef Mark Dixie directly in the restaurant where she worked, where he inflicted a stab wound.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nOb\u011b\u0165 i vrah spolu m\u011bli m\u00edt sex a kou\u0159it marihuanu, posl\u00e9ze ji zabil.": "The victim and the perpetrator had sex and marijuana, then he killed her.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nVrah pak sed\u011bl v nedalek\u00e9 kav\u00e1rn\u011b a sledoval pe\u010dlivou kriminalistickou pr\u00e1ci ohled\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed m\u00edsta \u010dinu.": "He sat in a nearby caf\u00e9 and watched with meticulous criminal investigation work as he tracked down the location of the crime scene.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nDixie, b\u00fdval\u00fd \u0161\u00e9fkucha\u0159, byl odsouzen v roce 2008 k odn\u011bt\u00ed svobody ve v\u00fd\u0161i 34 let za vra\u017edu a zn\u00e1siln\u011bn\u00ed modelky Sally.": "Former chef Dixie was sentenced to 34 years in prison for murder and assault of model Sally.", "Translate the following text from Czech to English. Output only the translation, no other text.\n\nText:\nTen u soudu p\u0159iznal pouze napaden\u00ed mladistv\u00e9 a pr\u00e1vn\u00edk tvrdil, \u017ee jeho klient na\u0161el u\u017e d\u00edvku mrtvou le\u017eet na ulici.": "He admitted only to being attacked by minors and argued that his client had found a dead girl lying on the street."}